{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-o095a","title":"蔡遗白吕蒙部曲事吕蒙无恨","accounts":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-o095a-account","label":"《周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传》正文","text":"蔡遗白吕蒙部曲事吕蒙无恨","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o095a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhouyu-p0060","role":"举报","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o095a-q"]},{"person":"lu-meng","role":"受白","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o095a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"吕蒙时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o095a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhouyu-e-o095a-q","source_order":[54,449,"O095a"],"order":9748}],"persons":[{"id":"zhouyu-p0060","name":"蔡遗","evidence":["zhouyu-q-o095"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhouyu-m-o095-zhouyu-p0060","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhouyu-q-o095"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-o095a-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-97e085c3fdd1c21f6aa4","layer":"original","quote":"常以部曲事为江夏太守蔡遗所白，蒙无恨意。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":448,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":27,"end":47},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o095","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-97e085c3fdd1c21f6aa4","layer":"original","quote":"蒙少不修书传〖13〗，每陈大事，常口占为笺疏〖14〗。常以部曲事为江夏太守蔡遗所白，蒙无恨意。及豫章太守顾邵卒〖15〗，权问所用；蒙因荐遗，奉职佳吏〖16〗。权笑曰：“君欲为祁奚耶〖17〗？”于是用之。甘宁粗暴好杀，既尝失蒙意，又时违权令，权怒之。蒙辄陈请：“天下未定，斗将如宁难得：宜容忍之。”权遂厚宁，卒得其用。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":448,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":158}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
